# ⛔ NO BLANKET *.dll / *.ico / *.lib RULE HERE, DELIBERATELY.
# The parent development repository has one, and it silently excluded nine files this
# release cannot build without: the seven vendored server dependencies under
# MHServerEmu/dep/, both WinUI ApplicationIcons, and MinHook's static library. They had to
# be copied back by hand. Do not reintroduce those patterns - the build breaks in ways that
# look like missing code rather than missing binaries.

# Server runtime state - never source
MHServerEmu/build/
**/Account.db
**/Account.db.bak*

# The mod's own runtime output
CostumeMod.log
CostumeMod.*.log
CostumeMod.arming
CostumeMod.quarantine

# Backups made by the installer
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]
*.prebatch.bak
*.preuniq.bak
*.prehex.bak
*.replaced
*.tmp
